Notebook[{Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["LicDongleAuthorizeWrite", "ObjectName", 
      CellID -> 365492538], Cell[TextData[{Cell["   ", "ModInfo"], 
        Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"LicDongleAuthorizeWrite", "[", 
            RowBox[{StyleBox["handle", "TI"], ",", StyleBox["key", "TI"]}], 
            "]"}]], "InlineFormula"], " \[LineSeparator]elevates the session \
to the write role with the dongle's write key."}], "Usage", 
      CellID -> 33469904], Cell["key is the write key as a ByteArray: a P-256 \
private key in PKCS#8 DER form.", "Notes", CellID -> 1146942363], 
     Cell["A dongle ships with the KeyNub write key, \
keys/keynub-shipping-writeauth.key.der in the SDK repository; \
LicDongleRotateWriteKey replaces it with one you hold.", "Notes", 
      CellID -> 1565893155], 
     Cell["The write role lasts until LicDongleSessionClose.", "Notes", 
      CellID -> 710054581], 
     Cell["The call needs a session; open one with LicDongleSessionOpen.", 
      "Notes", CellID -> 875955994], Cell["On failure the result is \
Failure[\"LicDongleError\", ...] with \"Status\" (the C status code), \
\"Operation\" and \"Detail\".", "Notes", CellID -> 1127298948]}, Open]], 
